<title>USA: New England Business approves 2 mln buyback.</title>
<headline>New England Business approves 2 mln buyback.</headline>
<dateline>GROTON, Mass. 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New England Business Service Inc said on Friday that its board has approved a repurchase plan for an additional two million shares over the next two years.</p>
<p>The company said it has fully completed an earlier repurchase plan for two million shares that began in May.</p>
<p>New England Business Services had about 13.47 million shares outstanding as of October 18.</p>
</text>
